    "title": "Special Weather Statement by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "33 minutes ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2026-04-22 22:44:00 CDT Expires: 2026-04-22 23:15:00 CDT Urgency: Expected Severity: Moderate Certainty: Observed Instruction: If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building. Target Area: Edmunds; Potter; Faulk At 1044 PM CDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm over Onaka, or 16 miles east of Hoven, moving northeast at 60 mph.\nHAZARD...Wind gusts of 50 to 55 mph and pea size hail.\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\nIMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around unsecured objects. Minor hail damage to vegetation is possible.\nLocations impacted include... Roscoe, Brentwood Colony, Evergreen Colony, Seneca, Tolstoy, Onaka, Thunderbird Colony, Blumengard Colony, Burkmere, Loyalton, and Norbeck.",
